{"id": "34164", "title": "恶质大男人", "author": "艾维", "category": "文学名著", "count": 45, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34164.htm", "intro": "那个曾经看她跌倒，不但没有伸出援手，反而不屑地看着她的窘态，叫她滚开，超级没有教养、不懂礼貌、只会讥讽，完全不知怜香惜玉的恶质臭男人，竟然是这所远近驰名的高等学府理事长，而且还是日本数一数二大集团的继承人！？看来她今后的大学生涯不好过了，谁教她那天一时气不过，招惹了他——这个阴险小人果然不会放过她！不但整她、为难她、威胁她，甚至趁着因为救她而受伤住院期间，利用她的愧疚感，把她当佣人来使唤！哼，虽然现在她被这个恶质男人吃得死死的，但她一定会想出办法摆脱他的魔掌的！", "base": "files/article/html/34/34164", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2171773.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2171774.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2171775.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2171776.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2171777.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2171778.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2171779.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2171780.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2171781.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2171782.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2171783.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2171784.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2171785.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2171786.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2171787.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2171788.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2171789.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2171790.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2171791.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2171792.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2171793.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2171794.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2171795.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2171796.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file"